<title>argentina: RUGBY UNION-ENGLAND BEAT CUYO 37-8 IN TOUR MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ENGLAND BEAT CUYO 37-8 IN TOUR MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>MENDOZA, Argentina 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>England beat Cuyo 37-8 (15-0) in their rugby union tour match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Cuyo - Try: Matias Brandi. Penalty: Adrian Gioeni.</p>
<p>England - Tries: Jim Mallinder 2, Jos Baxendell, Andy Gomarsall, Danny Grewcock, Mark Mapletoft. Conversions: Mapletoft 2. Penalty: Mapletoft.</p>
